      "SelfBuffAVanHelsingRegular": {
        "id": "SelfBuffAVanHelsingRegular",
        "found": true,
        "localization": {
          "name": "Divine Hunt",
          "description": "The user is granted Sleep Immunity for 50TU, Stun Immunity for 50TU, Poison Immunity for 50TU, an Instant Death Ward, and is Fortified.\n\nThen for the next 3 turns the user gets while on the battlefield, whenever the user uses another active skill, the user will immediately get the next turn, and become Enraged. These extra turns may be interrupted by other effects that influence the turn order (e.g. stuns targeting the lowest TU target). This will overwrite the effects of other Enrage skills on the user. Enraged units have their Attack increased to 1.5x until the end of their next turn.\n\nUsable only if a non-conjured ally unit on the battlefield has been defeated or sacrificed by any source since the user entered the battlefield or if the user has defeated a non-conjured enemy with an attack. This skill becomes locked for 50TU after use. Usable 3 times per battle.\n\nAn Instant Death Ward prevents this unit from being immediately defeated without damage by a non-boss enemy once, then is removed. Instant Death Wards cannot be ignored and cannot stack. A Fortified unit has 50% damage reduction from attacks. This reduction cannot be ignored by attacks that do not specifically ignore Fortify. Fortify will be removed after reducing damage 3 times since applying, and will be reset if reapplied. This is not a status effect.",
          "selected": "Grants immunities, Fortification, & Ward"
        },
